  "steps": [
    "Heat 1 tbsp oil in a skillet over medium-high. Cook the onion and peppers with a pinch of salt until softened and browned, about 15 minutes. Set aside.",
    "Preheat the oven to 450°F. Heat the remaining oil and cook the steak with the cumin, paprika, and chili powder until browned, 3-4 minutes.",
    "Brush one side of each tortilla with oil and lay it oiled side down. Layer cheese, fajita veggies, steak, and more cheese on one half, then fold in half.",
    "Bake on a parchment-lined sheet about 8 minutes, flipping halfway, until golden and melty.",
    "Stir the sour cream and chipotle vinaigrette together and serve with the quesadillas for dipping."
  ]
